{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（22日）下午1時42分，警方接報，深水埗西九龍中心一名60餘歲女子在扶手電梯跌倒，其後一度懷疑陷入昏迷。救援人員到場，事主回復清醒，隨即由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。案件列作有人意外受傷處理，警方正調查事故成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"深水埗西九龍中心發生扶手電梯意外。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201181454084608000726015.jpeg/r2K75l-CsfdicN93QEyQSd2cZ_wULC5s1WDQl_Bg0Jc\"/><figcaption>深水埗西九龍中心發生扶手電梯意外。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"深水埗西九龍中心發生扶手電梯意外。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201181456811036672453907.jpeg/Wr6yO_m8WSQAJBiWGXXP2IVeDmILDnQsevyx61_8ses\"/><figcaption>深水埗西九龍中心發生扶手電梯意外。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T07:03:48.438683+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T06:38:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T07:50:26.604154+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T06:57:23.114403+00:00","content_hash":"f1d714f9320642063c9c154df98501e72cdb61082dfdeefccf369a247b3c4279","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}